  "values_from": "the closed form at 50 significant digits (decimal arithmetic), rounded to binary64",
  "closed_form": {
   "law": "between events N is constant and x' = A x + p, A = [[-a, b], [a, -(b + k)]], a = G/V_cell, b = G/V_node, p = (P_cell, 0); x(tau) = e^{A tau} x0 + tau phi1(A tau) p and int_0^tau x = tau phi1(A tau) x0 + tau^2 phi2(A tau) p by Sylvester's formula on the eigenvalues of A (A = diag(0, -k) when G = 0); H, the transferred, produced and cleared amounts are linear in int x",
